[center][b]The Commonwealth family: made to work together[/b]
[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/109219]Rapport[/url]: runs the scenes · [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/109225]Chemistry[/url]: NPCs find each other · [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/109433]Overture[/url]: you talk someone into it · [b]Anatomy[/b] (this page): working genitals, arousal and contact · [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/109434]Anatomy Engine[/url]: the physics behind them · [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/109439]Silhouette[/url]: everyone gets a body of their own · [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/games/fallout4/collections/dmt85e]Ivy's Panties[/url]: all of it, installed for you[/center]

[center][size=4][b]New here? [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/articles/6679]The setup guide[/url]: from the body to the scenes, in one order, with what to take and what to skip.[/b][/size][/center]

[size=5][b][color=#ffb547]In short[/color][/b][/size]

[b]What you get[/b]
[list]
[*]Real genitals on your women: a vulva, a vaginal canal and an anus. They open and move when something touches them; they are not a painted texture.[/*]
[*]In sex scenes (AAF): the penis finds the right opening in any animation pack, the mouth opens around it, and our own sex sounds replace each pack's.[/*]
[*]Arousal: characters get aroused by scenes, nudity and watching, and their nipples show it.[/*]
[*]Men on BodyTalk 4 get a working anus too (M-M).[/*]
[/list][b]What you need[/b]: CBBE (or 3BBB) with BodySlide, F4SE, the [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/109434]Anatomy Engine[/url] and [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/108394]Runtime Database[/url]. AAF only if you want sex scenes.
[b]How it goes[/b]: install the mods, run the small AnatomyBuilder program once, then build "Anatomy Body" in BodySlide. Can't get the builder to work? Download the ready-made bodies instead (see [b]Install[/b]). Step by step: [b]Install[/b], below.

[size=5][b][color=#ffb547]What it is[/color][/b][/size]

In CBBE, a woman's body has closed skin where the genitals should be, and no bones there that physics could move. Anatomy adds real genitals (Nahka's model, fitted to today's CBBE) and the bones they need while the game runs. The [b]Anatomy Engine[/b] (fo4-ocbpc) then moves them when bodies touch, never by fixed poses.

[b]You make the body once, on your own PC.[/b] After installing, you run the Anatomy Builder, a small program. It builds the body from the CBBE, skin and skeleton you already have, so it matches them. If anything doesn't fit, it stops and tells you instead of guessing. Nahka's work ships only as a patch, with her permission.

[b]Bodies:[/b] the CBBE family for women (CBBE and 3BBB) and BodyTalk 4 for men. 3BBB also needs [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/39006]Skeletal Adjustments for CBBE[/url]. True Wasteland Body is optional: when it is installed, the AnatomyBuilder adds TWB's sliders to the Anatomy body, so TWB presets shape it too. Anatomy brings its own physics settings, so [b]don't add another physics preset[/b] (like [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/39195]MTM / OCBP[/url]): it is incompatible. 3BBB's own preset, which comes with 3BBB, is the exception: keep it.

[size=5][b][color=#ffb547]What you get[/color][/b][/size]

[center][size=4][b]Men get a real anus, women a real lining, and sex sounds from the engine for every animation pack.[/b][/size][/center]

[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-anatomy@497c254d44fa1fc28df6db8fe1fb50269bb6e963/docs/img/rig.jpg[/img][/center]
[center][b]Labia that move.[/b] No skeleton has bones there, so Anatomy adds 9 while the game runs: the lips part around what enters and settle back after. [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/articles/6673]Bodies and genitals →[/url][/center]

[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-ocbpc@4fd97d389a06af8af74607de29174308dd41a491/docs/img/aim.jpg[/img][/center]
[center][b]The penis finds the right opening.[/b] Animations are made for other bodies, so the shaft locks onto the opening the scene means and bends along the canal, in any animation pack. [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/articles/6675]Arousal and sex →[/url][/center]

[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-ocbpc@5b6d9837d62b2c86fc7e26e83d6282d1e7e8f185/docs/img/sounds.jpg[/img][/center]
[center][b]Sex sounds that match what happens.[/b] Every animation pack's built-in sounds are muted, and our own play from how deep and how fast each stroke really is. [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/articles/6675]Arousal and sex →[/url][/center]

[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-ocbpc@4fd97d389a06af8af74607de29174308dd41a491/docs/img/lips.jpg[/img][/center]
[center][b]A mouth that wraps around it.[/b] The mouth opens to fit what is at the lips, using the game's own face shapes (15 of them, measured). [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/articles/6675]Arousal and sex →[/url][/center]

[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-anatomy@8dbfadad254d1073a017109fcbfda9f966b8dd74/docs/img/mm.jpg[/img][/center]
[center][b]Men too (M-M).[/b] BodyTalk 4's own anus, opened on your body: a canal, the same physics as hers, the same aim and sounds. [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/articles/6676]Men and M-M →[/url][/center]

[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-anatomy@8dbfadad254d1073a017109fcbfda9f966b8dd74/docs/img/lining.jpg[/img][/center]
[center][b]Real detail inside.[/b] Instead of one flat colour, the inside has 14 folds and looks wet near the entrance. [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/articles/6673]Bodies and genitals →[/url][/center]

[center][b]3BBB bodies.[/b] The builder works on 3BBB when you have it and keeps 3BBB's breast bones. Want your outfits to fit 3BBB and BodyTalk? See [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/109602]Anatomy Tailor[/url].[/center]

[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-anatomy@497c254d44fa1fc28df6db8fe1fb50269bb6e963/docs/img/divider.png[/img][/center]

[size=5][b][color=#ffb547]Everything else, one line each[/color][/b][/size]

[b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/articles/6673]Bodies and genitals →[/url][/b]
[list]
[*]Nahka's genitals on YOUR CBBE: the rest of the body stays exactly the same, so every outfit still fits.[/*]
[*]The anus has a closed inside: you never see through the body.[/*]
[*]Genital textures cut from 53 MB to 3 MB: fine on a Steam Deck.[/*]
[/list][b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/articles/6674]The physics engine →[/url][/b]
[list]
[*]Contact is one smooth tube, not a string of balls, so nothing snags.[/*]
[*]Nothing shakes or jitters when bodies press together.[/*]
[*]After every load, a health check writes down what it found, and it watches your first scene too, so a problem gets a name.[/*]
[/list][b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/articles/6675]Arousal and sex →[/url][/b]
[list]
[*]With Rapport: moans in each partner's own voice, painful pleasure, and a climax.[/*]
[*]Arousal from scenes, nudity, watching others and a companion's own mood; nipples follow it.[/*]
[/list][b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/articles/6678]The AnatomyBuilder →[/url][/b]
[list]
[*]Built on your PC from your own CBBE: no CBBE or BodyTalk files are in the download.[/*]
[*]It builds 3BBB bodies and men's bodies too.[/*]
[/list][center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-anatomy@497c254d44fa1fc28df6db8fe1fb50269bb6e963/docs/img/divider.png[/img][/center]

[size=5][b][color=#ffb547]Install[/color][/b][/size]

[b]Install with Vortex or MO2; installing by hand is not supported.[/b] The installer first checks your setup and will not run without CBBE.
[list=1]
[*]Install the [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/109434]Anatomy Engine[/url] (1.2.0 or newer) and [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/108394]Runtime Database[/url], then Anatomy.[/*]
[*]Download [b]AnatomyBuilder 1.2.6[/b] from [url=https://github.com/ReidenXerx/fo4-anatomy/releases/tag/v1.2.6]GitHub[/url]. Unpack it into a folder of its own and run [font=Courier New]AnatomyBuilder.exe[/font] once. MO2 users: add it to MO2's executables, the same way as BodySlide. 1.2.6 brings True Wasteland Body's sliders when TWB is installed, works with 8K skins and adds the BodySlide preset "Anatomy Zeroed Sliders". [url=https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/1c1421a2cc3d3cdbe576ee1a21b6839fd36db82aec8ccd9a5240c332c2b9dba4]VirusTotal: 0 of 75[/url] for this build's zip.[/*]
[*]Open BodySlide and build "Anatomy Body" with your preset. For men, build "Anatomy Male Body" (or "... Uncut") instead of BodyTalk4.[/*]
[*]Optional: after every BodySlide build, run AnatomyRebuild (from the same GitHub page). It fixes the hips on your outfits.[/*]
[/list][b]Coming from 1.1.1?[/b] Install the new Engine and Anatomy over the old ones, run AnatomyBuilder 1.2.6 again, and rebuild in BodySlide. Your saves keep working.

[b]Can't run the AnatomyBuilder? Download the ready-made bodies.[/b] [b]Anatomy Bodies (prebuilt)[/b] on the Files tab (optional files): CBBE or 3BBB for women, BodyTalk 4 for men, ready to use. The installer lets you pick her body (CBBE or 3BBB) and his (BodyTalk 4, cut or uncut).
[list]
[*]They are built at zero sliders with their morphs, so Silhouette and LooksMenu BodyGen still give every NPC their own shape. Build your outfits at zero too ("CBBE Zeroed Sliders", "BT - Zero").[/*]
[*]The genitals' skin tone matches CBBE's own skin. With another skin mod, run the AnatomyBuilder once to match yours.[/*]
[*]Needs Anatomy, CBBE and the Anatomy Engine 1.2.10. The 3BBB body also needs 3BBB and Skeletal Adjustments for CBBE; the men's body needs BodyTalk 4 (for its skin textures).[/*]
[*]In Vortex or MO2, let it win the file conflict (FemaleBody / MaleBody) over your BodySlide output and over CBBE and BodyTalk.[/*]
[*]Another physics preset is incompatible; 3BBB's own preset, which comes with 3BBB, is the exception.[/*]
[/list][quote]
[b]Needs:[/b] the Anatomy Engine 1.2.0 or newer, F4SE, [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/108394]Runtime Database[/url], CBBE 2.7.2 with its BodySlide files, BodySlide. Fallout 4 1.10.163 or the Anniversary Edition.
[b]Optional:[/b] AAF (sex scenes), Rapport (moans, faces, glances), LooksMenu (nipples, glans colour), MCM (settings), BodyTalk 4 with its BodySlide files (M-M), 3BBB with [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/39006]Skeletal Adjustments for CBBE[/url].

[b]It overwrites nothing from your other mods.[/b] Anatomy's physics settings sit in their own folder and are read after yours. The builder only writes new files, one step at a time, and stops with a clear message rather than guess.
[b]Anatomy tells you in game if F4SE or the Engine is missing:[/b] a message box says what to install, and only appears when something is wrong.[/quote][size=5][b][color=#ffb547]Incompatibilities[/color][/b][/size]

Known conflicts, from real reports and the code. Found another one? Tell us in the Bugs tab.
[list]
[*][b]Animated Fannies (LoversLab 4302)[/b]: both build the same body file (FemaleBody.nif), so whichever you build last wins. Anatomy already includes its vulva and anus, rebuilt, so build only "Anatomy Body".[/*]
[*][b]Other women's bodies (BodyTalk women, Fusion Girl, or any body except CBBE 2.7.2 or 3BBB)[/b]: the builder refuses them, because the genitals only fit CBBE and 3BBB.[/*]
[*][b]Other physics presets (MTM / OCBP, MadKita's, Jiggle Physics presets and the like)[/b]: Anatomy brings its own physics settings, made for the body the AnatomyBuilder built. Another preset replaces them, and the breasts and butt move wrong. Don't install one. 3BBB's own preset, which comes with 3BBB, is the exception: keep it.[/*]
[*][b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/105699]OCBP LPCE[/url][/b]: it brings its own physics file, which replaces the Anatomy Engine, so the genitals, the mouth and the aim stop moving. Use one or the other.[/*]
[*][b]BodyTalk3 men[/b]: the redder glans colour is made for BodyTalk4. On BodyTalk3, switch "Glans colour" off in MCM.[/*]
[*][b]BC7 skins (many 4K skin mods, e.g. Unfair Skin)[/b]: they work. The builder can't save that format, so it saves the genitals' colour texture uncompressed: about 5 MB at 4K (about 85 MB with builders older than 1.0.11), a bit bigger than with a normal (DXT) skin. Run the latest builder and rebuild "Anatomy Body".[/*]
[*][b]Men's skeletons other than [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/36702]ZeX - ZaZ Extended Skeleton[/url][/b]: the penis can only aim with ZeX's linked penis bones (Penis_00 to Penis_05 in one chain). With any other men's skeleton, aiming switches itself off (the log says so) and the penis keeps the animation's own pose. Use ZeX 6.0 for the men.[/*]
[/list][size=5][b][color=#ffb547]FAQ[/color][/b][/size]

[b]Do I need AAF?[/b]
[spoiler]Only for sex scenes: AAF is what plays them. The bodies themselves don't need it.[/spoiler]

[b]Something looks wrong. What do I send?[/b]
[spoiler]Post in the Bugs tab with Anatomy_Health.txt (Documents/My Games/Fallout4/F4SE). The engine writes it about 10 seconds after every load; it names the engine, the physics preset, the body and every character it simulates. After your first AAF scene it adds who was in it, how often the penis was inside her (or a mouth or hand), whether her openings were found, and what to fix when they weren't.[/spoiler]

[b]What are the two tools?[/b]
[spoiler]The Anatomy Builder and Anatomy Rebuild are small programs written in Python, packed so you don't need to install Python. They are not in the Nexus download; get them from GitHub. Their source is in [url=https://github.com/ReidenXerx/fo4-anatomy]the public repository[/url] ([font=Courier New]tools/builder.py[/font], [font=Courier New]tools/rebuild.py[/font]).[/spoiler]

[b]Does it work with my other mods?[/b]
[spoiler]Yes with: AAF and UAP, LooksMenu, Rapport, Silhouette (nipples stay flat under heavy armour it marks), Overture and Ivy (they add arousal), CBBE HeadRear Absolute Fix, BodyTalk4 men, and Anatomy Tailor's refits.[/spoiler]

[b]Where are the settings?[/b]
[spoiler]MCM, page "Anatomy": the arousal nipples and how strong they get, how fast arousal rises and fades, each arousal source, and the glans colour. The sticky posts list every feature and setting.[/spoiler]

